+"""``cswap chrome`` first-open preparation: the new account's profile is a
+copy of the stock Chrome's last-used profile minus its claude.ai cookies,
+named after the account, with a window colour of its own; and
+``chrome.followSwitch`` brings the account's browser forward after
+``cswap switch``.
+"""
